'''Rupa & Company Limited''' is an Indian clothing company which makes [[Knitted fabric|knitted garments]].<ref>{{cite news |last1=Roy |first1=Shobha |title=Rupa & Company Ltd eyes 18% growth in sales in FY22 |url=https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/companies/rupa-company-ltd-eyes-18-growth-in-sales-in-fy22/article35971302.ece |access-date=31 January 2023 |work=The Hindu Businessline |date=18 August 2021 |language=en |archive-date=31 January 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230131155700/https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/companies/rupa-company-ltd-eyes-18-growth-in-sales-in-fy22/article35971302.ece |url-status=live }}</ref> The Company is primarily engaged in the manufacture of hosiery products in knitted undergarments casual wears and thermal wears. It produces [[Undergarment|innerwear]], [[casual wear]], [[Winter clothing|thermal wear]] and [[Nightwear|sleepwear]] for men, women, and kids.<ref>{{cite news |title=Rupa's well-knit plans for consolidation |url=https://businessindia.co/magazine/rupas-well-knit-plans-for-consolidation |access-date=31 January 2023 |work=Business India |language=en |archive-date=30 January 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230130154730/https://www.businessindia.co/magazine/rupas-well-knit-plans-for-consolidation |url-status=live }}</ref> While Frontline is its flagship brand, the Rupa family also consists of brands like Softline, Euro, Bumchums, Torrido, Thermocot, Macroman, Footline, and Jon. Rupa was founded and established by brothers [[Prahlad Rai Agarwala|PR Agarwala]], GP Agarwala and KB Agarwala in 1968 when the erstwhile [[hosiery]] market was at a nascent stage and mainly addressed by unorganized players.<ref>{{cite news |title=Rupa & Company: The inside story |url=https://www.fortuneindia.com/enterprise/rupa-company-the-inside-story/104544 |access-date=31 January 2023 |work=Fortune India |language=en |archive-date=24 May 2020 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200524030828/https://www.fortuneindia.com/enterprise/rupa-company-the-inside-story/104544 |url-status=live }}</ref>

==Products==
Rupa produces [[Waistcoat|vests]], [[briefs]], [[Undergarment|drawers]], [[Bermuda shorts]], [[Capris]], [[T-shirts]], lounge wear, [[boxer short]]s and sleepwear for men; and [[bra]]s, [[panties]], [[camisoles]] and [[leggings]] for women. It also manufactures baba suits, [[bloomers]] and slips for infants/toddlers, and lounge-wear, Bermuda shorts and T-shirts for kids. Thermal wear is another major category that Rupa caters to: It offers winter wear for both men and women.{{fact|date=May 2025}}

